  aciklama:
  - "Fas\xFClyede makbul de\u011Fildir konserve, dibini bilmedi\u011Fin denizlerde
    boy verme, yaln\u0131z\u0131m diye kendini kap\u0131p koyuverme, {{ay_2}} ay\u0131n\u0131n
    {{kelime, ortas\u0131n\u0131 | sonlar\u0131n\u0131 | ba\u015Flar\u0131n\u0131}}
    sab\u0131rs\u0131zl\u0131kla bekle. Maharetli biri sana do\u011Fru yakla\u015F\u0131yor
    ve onu {{kelime, d\xF6vmesinden | elektroni\u011Fe olan merak\u0131ndan | \xE7ald\u0131\u011F\u0131
    m\xFCzik aletinden | dalgal\u0131 sa\xE7lar\u0131ndan | takt\u0131\u011F\u0131
    apple watch'dan | sa\u011F kolundaki benlerden | ka\u015Flar\u0131n\u0131n kavisinden
    | \xE7ok kitap okumas\u0131ndan | resim yapmaya olan ilgisinden | giyim ku\u015Fam\u0131na
    g\xF6sterdi\u011Fi \xF6zenden | Sketchers ayakkab\u0131lar\u0131ndan | Nike ayakkab\u0131lar\u0131ndan
    | telefonuna takt\u0131\u011F\u0131 ilgin\xE7 k\u0131l\u0131ftan | yemek yapmaya
    olan merak\u0131ndan}} tan\u0131yacaks\u0131n."
